 {
  "verse_id": "tsa-a21-v06",
  "song": "tsa-a21",
  "verse": 6,
  "lines": [
   "Like the brahma-killing-prohibition: ritual-distinction",
   "and ritual-excellence — in its absence",
   "somewhere unqualified: same, like the ashrama-distinction;",
   "and from fruit-excellence, excellence just-there.",
   "In Upaniṣad-Bhāgavata, distinct-authorship even,",
   "being-made-by-all-knowers is conceivable here —",
   "from meaning-conjunction in what is said and beyond.",
   "In eternality even, the scriptures' recognition:",
   "for-now necessarily-reached, rooted in",
   "inference-elimination-perception-and-rest — their authority.",
   "'I see gold, silver' — indeed,",
   "the recognition is scripture, through goldsmith-recognition.",
   "Some seen-fruit a desirer enjoys:",
   "child's engagement by recognition just,",
   "not-by-inference-and-elimination — then,",
   "from those two's absence, in youth",
   "its presence is powerless. But rooting recognition,",
   "he — let him be — for someone, some work:",
   "some giving invisible-impotence-nature-dissolution-solitude fruits,",
   "some Śiva-equality, some oneness-ending —",
   "she severally many-kinded: thus in a world",
   "filled with many recognitions, whoever to-be,",
   "he such recognition by force assumes,",
   "ending in the heart."
  ],
  "sanskrit_cite": "brahmahananatanniṣedhavat saṃskārabhedaḥ saṃskārātiśayaḥ tadabhāve kvacit anadhikṛtatvam iti samānam āśramabhedavat phalotkarṣāc ca utkarṣaḥ tatraiva upaniṣadbhāgavat bhinnakartṛkatve 'pi sarvasarvajñakṛtatvam atra saṃbhāvyate taduktatadatiriktayuktārthayogāt nityatve 'pi āgamānāṃ prasiddhiḥ tāvat avaśyopagamyā anvayavyatirekādhyakṣādīnāṃ tatprāmāṇyasya tanmūlatvāt satyaṃ rajataṃ paśyāmi iti hi sauvarṇikādiparaprasiddhyaiva prasiddhir eva āgamaḥ sā kācit dṛṣṭaphalā bubhukṣito bhuṅkte iti bālasya prasiddhita eva tatra tatra pravṛttiḥ nānvayavyatirekābhyāṃ tadā tayoḥ abhāvāt yauvanāvasthāyāṃ tadbhāvo 'pi akiṃcitkaraḥ prasiddhiṃ tu mūlīkṛtya so 'stu kasmaicit kāryāya kācit adṛṣṭavaidehyaprakṛtilayapuruṣakaivalyaphaladā kācit śivasamānatvaphaladā kācit aikyaparyavasāyinī sā ca pratyekam anekavidhā ity evaṃ bahutaraprasiddhipūrṇe jagati yo yādṛśo bhaviṣyan sa tādṛśīm eva prasiddhiṃ balād eva hṛdayaparyavasāyinīm abhimanyate",
